# Approach detected dog to standoff distance
# Goal
float32 standoff_distance  # Minimum 1.0m per SYS-FND-3
float32 max_speed           # Capped at 0.15 m/s near dog
---
# Result
bool success
string message
float32 final_distance
geometry_msgs/Point final_position
---
# Feedback
float32 current_distance
float32 current_speed
geometry_msgs/Point robot_position
